{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02966","headline":"和黄门卢监望秦始皇陵 · 张九龄","name":"和黄门卢监望秦始皇陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦帝始求仙，骊山何遽卜。\n中年既无效，兹地所宜复。\n徒役如雷奔，珍怪亦云蓄。\n黔首无寄命，赭衣相追逐。\n人怨神亦怒，身死宗遂覆。\n土崩失天下，龙鬬入函谷。\n国爲项籍屠，君同华元戮。\n始掘既由楚，终焚乃因牧。\n上宰议扬贤，中阿感桓速。\n一闻过秦论，载怀空杼轴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}